    "identifier": "hoshi-kujaku-art-feather-slice",
    "description": "<p>You conjure a collection of feather shaped star chakra and spin, fanning them out like blades of radiation cutting everything in their vicinity. All creatures in range must make a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d8 force damage on a failed save, or half as much on a success.</p>\n<p>Irradiated: These star chakra tail feathers leave a burning radiation trail in the wounds it leaves behind. Creatures that fail their saving throw cannot regain hit points until the end of their next turn and if they are Invisible have that invisibility dispelled.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-rank, increase the cost of the jutsu by 3 (or 2-star chakra), the damage by 1d8.</p>",
